        <Starjack MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,Ludeon.RimWorld.Odyssey">0.02</Starjack>
        <VREA_AndroidAwakened MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,vanillaracesexpanded.android">0.02</VREA_AndroidAwakened>
        <Stoneborn MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,det.stoneborn">0.02</Stoneborn>
        <DV_Bogleg MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,det.boglegs">0.02</DV_Bogleg>
        <AG_Lapis MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech,sarg.alphagenes">0.02</AG_Lapis>
      </xenotypeChances>
    </xenotypeSet>
    <fixedIdeo>true</fixedIdeo>
    <ideoName>The Turning Wheel</ideoName>
    <ideoDescription>Nothing is broken, only waiting. What others throw away is bought, mended and sold back better, and nothing on the Wheel is wasted, least of all a person. The Wheel is everyone on it together: what one yard earns the whole town eats, and no one hand stops it turning. The road is home, because standing still is how the fire catches you. Mab Wainwright drove out ahead of the flames with her house on her cart, and nobody has ever voted to stop.</ideoDescription>
    <forcedMemes>
      <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Ideology">Collectivist</li>
      <!-- Salvage bought and sold back better: Vanilla Ideology Expanded's scrapper. -->
